"text": "Authors This project is the M.Tech dissertation work of Dhiraaj K V, carried out at the Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Amrita School of Computing, Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Coimbatore. Author Dhiraaj K V M.Tech student, Computer Science and Engineering LinkedIn profile ↗ Research supervisor Dr. Raghesh Krishnan K Assistant Professor (Sl.Gd.), Department of Computer Science and Engineering Amrita faculty page ↗ More in this section # Page Topic Publication The paper and the project's progress Glossary Short explanations of the terms used on this site References Every paper the work builds on Thanks # CBIS-DDSM is made available by The Cancer Imaging Archive, and INbreast by its authors (Moreira et al., 2012)."
